# Repo-root build context, shared by all three Dockerfiles (src/Flare.Ingest,
# src/Flare.Api, and - since MemoryPack TypeScript codegen needs Flare.Api's source
# alongside it (ADR-0016) - src/dashboard too; it no longer has its own separate
# .dockerignore).
.git
.github
.vscode
.agents
.claude

**/bin/
**/obj/

src/dashboard/node_modules
src/dashboard/.svelte-kit
src/dashboard/build
src/dashboard/.env
src/dashboard/.env.*
!src/dashboard/.env.example

*.md
!README.md
